From 19bfe10ab396fc059d87ed370f87f4207c733358 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DSMO <dsmo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:47:59 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 08/12] DSMO: the app's name in what users see
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Made by DSMO's native/brand/rename_strings.py; rerun it on a new base.

- AppInfo name and wordmark, android:label, default applicationId
  io.github.dsmo.app (still overridable with -PapiDemoApplicationId=);
- 79 strings (zh and en, ARB parts, merged ARBs and the generated L10n),
  the Android string resources and the Kotlin notification titles;
- the accessibility service is listed as DSMO 手机操控 / DSMO Phone Control,
  and the pairing notification is DSMO's;
- the app's folders: Download/DSMO, Pictures/DSMO, Movies/DSMO, with the
  agent's storage note and the strings that mention them.

Kept as DSH Go: attribution, dsh-Go's plugin protocol and versions,
share formats both apps open, the usage statistics (sent to dsh-Go's
server) and the AI usage guide.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EvNzunV3oTNc3v18wvhEA9
